==Battleground==
*The enemy base is protected by a [[Base Barrier]] until the boss is defeated.
*The enemy base here is a [[Goal Plate Base (Enemy Base)|Goal Plate Base]].
*10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Tails (Enemy)|Tails]] spawns as the boss.
**15 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**15 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

